exports[`page generator output (characterization) > NamespacePageGenerator renders a namespace 1`] = `
"---
title: Codecs | Namespace | API
description: A collection of utility functions for encoding and serialising data.
---

import { SourceCode } from "@rspress/core/theme";
import { ApiSignature, ApiExample } from "rspress-plugin-api-extractor/runtime";

# Codecs

A collection of utility functions for encoding and serialising data.

<ApiSignature code={"namespace Codecs {\\n    function binary(data: unknown): Uint8Array;\\n    function json<T>(data: T): string;\\n    function streaming<T>(source: DataSource<T>): AsyncIterable<Uint8Array>;\\n}"} source={"namespace Codecs {\\n    function binary(data: unknown): Uint8Array;\\n    function json<T>(data: T): string;\\n    function streaming<T>(source: DataSource<T>): AsyncIterable<Uint8Array>;\\n}"} apiScope={"kitchensink"} />

## Functions

- [binary](/api/function/codecs.binary) - Encodes a value to a \`Uint8Array\` using UTF-8 binary encoding.
- [json](/api/function/codecs.json) - Serialises a value to a JSON string.
- [streaming](/api/function/codecs.streaming) - Returns an async iterable that streams encoded chunks from a DataSource.

"
`;

